            <titlePart>for WHIST, </titlePart>
            <titlePart rend="italic">which reſolves almoſt | all the critcal Caſes that may
                happen at the Game. | </titlePart>
            <titlePart>To which is added, | An ARTIFICIAL MEMORY: | Or, An eaſy Method of
                aſſiſting the Memory of | thoſe that play at the </titlePart>
            <titlePart rend="smallcap">Game </titlePart>
